{
  "info": {
    "name": "Sistema de Extensao UFMA (P3)",
    "description": "Endpoints REST completos com JWT.\n\nPasso 1 — execute 'Autenticar' (pasta Autenticacao): o token e salvo automaticamente em {{token}}.\nPasso 2 — todos os demais requests ja enviam Authorization: Bearer {{token}}.\n\nSeed (senha 123): doc@ufma.br (DOCENTE id=1), coord1@ufma.br (COORDENADOR id=2), comissao@ufma.br (COMISSAO id=3), admin@ufma.br (ADMINISTRADOR id=4), aluno1@ufma.br (Discente id=5), aluno2@ufma.br (Discente id=6).\nCurso id=1 | Grupo id=1 | Oportunidades id=1..7 | Solicitacoes aproveitamento id=1..4.\nEndpoints sem autenticacao: POST /api/usuarios, POST /api/usuarios/autenticar, POST /api/discentes.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base",  "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string", "description": "Preenchido automaticamente pelo request Autenticar" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "Autenticacao",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Autenticar (salva token automaticamente)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token); }"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios/autenticar", "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios","autenticar"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@ufma.br\",\n  \"senha\": \"123\"\n}" }
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Usuarios",
      "description": "Abertos sem token: POST / e POST /autenticar. Demais: token obrigatorio. PUT/DELETE: papel ADMINISTRADOR.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar usuario (sem token)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios", "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Novo Usuario\",\n  \"email\": \"novo@ufma.br\",\n  \"senha\": \"123\",\n  \"matricula\": \"2024999\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por nome ou email",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios/obter?nome=Ana",
              "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios","obter"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "nome",  "value": "Ana" },
                { "key": "email", "value": "", "disabled": true }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios/1", "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios","1"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar [ADMIN]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios/1", "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios","1"] },
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Prof. Joao Docente (atualizado)\",\n  \"email\": \"doc@ufma.br\",\n  \"senha\": \"123\",\n  \"matricula\": \"DOC001\"\n}" }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Desativar conta [ADMIN]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios/5/desativar", "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios","5","desativar"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Reativar conta [ADMIN]",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios/5/reativar", "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios","5","reativar"] }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover [ADMIN]",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": { "raw": "{{base}}/api/usuarios/7", "host": ["{{base}}"], "path": ["api","usuarios","7"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },

